<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Queensland Metals posts half yr loss.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Queensland Metals posts half yr loss.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     loss 3.60 vs loss 2.92</p>
<p>    Net				loss 7.28 vs profit 2.70</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	   nil   vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Queensland Metals Corp (QMC) Ltd is a magnesium miner.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  14.46  vs  20.76</p>
<p>    Other income			  4.33  vs   6.15</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		    loss 3.17  vs profit 2.26</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		 loss 7.28  vs gain 2.70</p>
<p>    Tax				     nil   vs   nil</p>
<p>    Interest expense		    1.89  vs  1.77</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  3.42  vs  3.18</p>
<p>    Minorities			    nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
